TiDB City replaces PGSimCity's PostgreSQL-specific simulation, visual
geography, explanatory surfaces, and optional in-browser PostgreSQL runtime
with a deterministic educational model of TiDB v8.5 LTS architecture.
Substantial changes include the TiDB state model, Raft and transaction traces,
the TiDB city world, Japanese and English interfaces, the machine and diagnose
pages, scenarios, tests, and build/deployment configuration.

TiDB, TiKV, TiFlash, PingCAP, and their associated marks are used only to
identify the technologies described by this educational model. No official
logos or brand assets are included. TiDB City is an independent project and is
not affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by, or approved by PingCAP, Inc.

